Package: CoDaStereo
Title: Compositional Data Analysis for Stereological and Histomorphometric Data
Version: 3.0.0
Authors@R: person("Diogo B.", "Provete", email = "diogo.provete@ufms.br",
                  role = c("aut", "cre"),
                  comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-0097-0651"))
Description: Interactive 'shiny' application for compositional data
    analysis of stereological, histomorphometric and blood-cell count data
    under the Aitchison geometry. It covers data upload and inspection, zero
    and missing-value replacement, ternary diagrams, centred log-ratio
    biplots, user-editable sequential binary partitions with CoDa
    dendrograms, and permutational multivariate analysis of variance on
    isometric log-ratio coordinates, optionally including the
    log-transformed total as described by Pawlowsky-Glahn, Egozcue and
    Lovell (2015) <doi:10.1177/1471082X14535526>.
